es where they repeatedly create `request.MultipartForm` resources, resulting in additional memory allocations.\\n\\nOf course, we can also choose not to handle it, but we need to remind users to process `c.Request.MultipartForm.RemoveAll()`.\\n\\n----\\n\\nI'd like to hear your opinions: @akats7 @open-telemetry/go-approvers \\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-ISSUE-01]\\n\\n# Issue: Using otelgin.Middleware will cause temporary MultipartForm files not to be destroyed. (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib#5946)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/5946  \\n\\n**Author**: zacklpx  \\n\\n**Created**: 2024-07-25T03:50:39Z · **Updated**: 2025-07-03T13:28:05Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: open  \\n\\n**Labels**: bug, area: instrumentation, instrumentation: otelgin  \\n\\n**Milestone**: —\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Timeline\\n\\n- 2024-07-25T03:50:39Z · **labeled** by zacklpx `area: instrumentation`\\n\\n- 2024-07-25T03:50:39Z · **labeled** by zacklpx `bug`\\n\\n- 2024-07-25T03:50:39Z · **labeled** by zacklpx `instrumentation: otelgin`\\n\\n- 2024-11-21T12:21:58Z · **cross-referenced** by flc1125 ← https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/4588\\n\\n- 2025-01-13T13:45:45Z · **cross-referenced** by Yiling-J ← https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/pull/6609\\n\\n- 2025-07-02T08:06:05Z · **marked_as_duplicate** by dmathieu\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"howev this approach will also introduc addit side effect for which there is current no better solut impact assum our middlewar is wrap in the follow manner m1 m2 otel middlewar m3 fn where m1 and m2 intern implement oper such a request parsemultipartform 1 due to the effect of removeal in otel middlewar there may be case where they repeat creat request multipartform resourc result in addit memori alloc of cours we can also choos not to handl it but we need to remind user to process c request multipartform removeal i d like to hear your opinion akats7 open telemetri go approv sourc id src issu 01 issu use otelgin middlewar will caus temporari multipartform file not to be destroy open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 5946 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 5946 author zacklpx creat 2024 07 25t03 50 39z updat 2025 07 03t13 28 05z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state open label bug area instrument instrument otelgin mileston timelin 2024 07 25t03 50 39z label by zacklpx area instrument 2024 07 25t03 50 39z label by zacklpx bug 2024 07 25t03 50 39z label by zacklpx instrument otelgin 2024 11 21t12 21 58z cross referenc by flc1125 http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 4588 2025 01 13t13 45 45z cross referenc by yile j http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib pull 6609 2025 07 02t08 06 05z mark _ a _ duplic by dmathieu\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"074abb7e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-5946.md\", \"id\": \"3d9f13e5d694d977\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.38965495569165665, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.19651922241665237, \"vector_similarity\": 0.840305, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-5946.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"074abb7e8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-5946.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/issues/opentelemetry-go-contrib-5946.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 16121, \"chunk_count\": 10, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:04\", \"token_count\": 5002, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**flc11